  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">sesame crackers slip into the kitchen with an irresistible crunch, flecked with golden sesame seeds and a sprinkle of sea salt. Stir up a quick dough with olive oil instead of butter and a touch of agave for gentle sweetness, then roll it thin, press on extra seeds, and bake until the edges turn amber and crisp. The toasty aroma invites snacking straight from the pan, and every bite feels light, wholesome, and joyful. Perfect for afternoon nibbling, pairing with creamy hummus, or packing into jars as a cheerful gift, sesame crackers make simple ingredients sing.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-sesame-crackers\">Why You’ll Love This sesame crackers</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-sesame-crackers\">How to Make Sesame Crackers</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-sesame-crackers\">Pro Tips for Making sesame crackers</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-sesame-crackers\">How to Serve this sesame crackers</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-sesame-crackers\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This sesame crackers</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Perfectly crunchy for satisfying snack cravings.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Nutty flavor that pairs beautifully with dips.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make and customize with your favorite spices.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Healthy alternative to traditional chips and snacks.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-6256\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"6256\" data-servings=\"8\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-mea